{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56730","headline":"题狼山慈航院（题拟） · 无名氏","name":"题狼山慈航院（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞来灵鹫岭，化作宝陀山。\n（见宋王辟之《渑水燕谈录》卷七。\n）（〖1〗《渑水燕谈录》：「通州狼山广教寺，在唐爲慈航院，在江中山上，昔人有诗云：〖略〗。\n前後乃江海相接处，舟出二山间，水湍碍石，率多覆溺。\n昔有僧率其徒，操楫以获之，舟无触石之患，故有慈航之名。\n近年江水南徙，山之前後皆陆田，後人又有诗云：『昔年船底浪，今日马蹄痕。\n』皆纪实也。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56730.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56730","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}